[*]
[*] GTKWave save file — tb_pipe7_msgbus : M2P/P2M message-bus master + regfile
[*] Open via:  make gtkwave WAVE_TB=msgbus
[*]
[dumpfile] "msgbus.vcd"
[timestart] 0
[size] 1600 900
[pos] -1 -1
[sst_width] 280
[signals_width] 340
[sst_expanded] 1
@200
-Clock / Reset
@28
tb_pipe7_msgbus.pclk
tb_pipe7_msgbus.reset_n
@200
-Request in  (controller -> master)
@28
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_valid
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_write
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_committed
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_ready
@22
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_addr[11:0]
tb_pipe7_msgbus.req_wdata[7:0]
@200
-Message bus  (M2P -> PHY, P2M -> MAC)
@22
tb_pipe7_msgbus.master.state[2:0]
tb_pipe7_msgbus.m2p[7:0]
tb_pipe7_msgbus.p2m[7:0]
tb_pipe7_msgbus.responder.rstate[2:0]
@200
-Response  (master -> controller)
@28
tb_pipe7_msgbus.rsp_valid
tb_pipe7_msgbus.rsp_is_read
@22
tb_pipe7_msgbus.rsp_rdata[7:0]
@200
-Scoreboard
@28
tb_pipe7_msgbus.completions
tb_pipe7_msgbus.errors
